  if(n===1){await choose(leader);await open('current',{partyId:id});const tactic=await confirmWrite(routes.action,frame.locator(ssr('tactic')+'[data-tactic="deep"]'));const changed=rawRun(await state(),id);assert.equal(changed.state.nextTactic,'deep');assert.equal(changed.state.stageTactics[1],'steady');evidence.nextTactic={result:tactic,effectiveAfterStage:2};persist();}
